		Add("Priotize Red Hot if you have firesnaking buff, and Deep Blue if you have watersnaking buff (also applies to Normal).", "불뱀 버프가 있으면 Red Hot을, 물뱀 버프가 있으면 Deep Blue를 우선(일반 난이도에도 적용).");
